### 参数解析瀑布流

代码内置 5 条 ID 提取路径，按优先级依次尝试：

```
Path 1: doi_landing_page → 正则 /collections/[^/]+/(\d+)
Path 2: dataset_url       → 正则 /collections/[^/]+/(\d+)
Path 3: doi               → 正则 \.c\.(\d+)$   (Figshare Collection DOI 特征)
